WEBVTT

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:10.550
It's a shooting star!

00:00:10.930 --> 00:00:13.080
Wow! That was a big one, huh?

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:15.380
Huh? What are you doing?

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:17.780
I'm making a wish on that shooting star

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:21.440
and asking it to send us a child of our very own someday, okay?

00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:22.630
I see!

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:02.370
That lion's got a baby in his mouth!

00:01:02.610 --> 00:01:04.060
Hey, wait!

00:01:05.070 --> 00:01:21.880
This day, eight years ago,

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:25.960
a child was delivered into the arms of Mr. and Mrs. Amami.

00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:29.950
Who could have known that he would one day hold the key to life?

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:36.250
or death for all of mankind but back then there wasn't a person on earth who had the slightest

00:01:36.250 --> 00:01:37.510
notion of this truth

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:21.550
I'll never forgive you

00:02:30.700 --> 00:02:35.310
I was a young man with a big heart

00:02:35.310 --> 00:02:39.820
I'm a cute T-boy

00:03:03.290 --> 00:03:14.050
This is the story of the brave men and women who fight to save the human race of the King of Braves.

00:03:19.930 --> 00:03:28.540
The 21st century. The cities are overrun with goods and people, and there is no refuge to be found from the endless overdevelopment.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:36.100
facade of this discernible peace. The most powerful enemy ever to confront mankind. An

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:39.620
evil beyond all imagination has begun to stir.

00:03:40.520 --> 00:03:46.080
Fate haunted ones, you shall bear witness to my infinite power.

00:03:47.980 --> 00:03:52.120
...blooded with garbage that no matter how often we recycle, we just can't keep pace anymore.

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:56.380
We've come here today to Garbage Island to observe all the trash discarded here and to

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:59.820
consider how we can use our limited resources more effectively.

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:02.320
I want you to think it over, children.

00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:05.660
You'll be turning in reports on the subject later.

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:09.720
Try not to get hurt on your own.

00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:18.870
One would already toss a 2002 flat panel TV.

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:20.530
Seems like such a waste.

00:04:20.710 --> 00:04:21.440
Hey, cool.

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:24.040
This portable mini disc player still works.

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:25.800
This place stinks.

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:29.960
Why'd they even buy this in the first place if they were just going to...

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.520
throw it out when it's not even broken.

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:43.590
I'm having a really bad feeling.

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:10.520
It nearly gave me a heart attack!

00:05:58.800 --> 00:05:59.060
What?

00:05:59.140 --> 00:05:59.980
No, nothing at all.

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:03.590
Galleon!

00:06:05.100 --> 00:06:08.540
Shuling, I have an emergency to take care of. I'm leaving you in charge.

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:09.220
Yes, sir.

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:13.090
All right, Sakura, I'll see you later.

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:14.330
Yes, Mr. President.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:33.400
Professor, will you please come down? It's dangerous up there!

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:38.280
Oh, quit nagging already! I've already told you, I've done this a hundred times!

00:06:38.720 --> 00:06:38.980
Huh?

00:06:40.190 --> 00:06:40.930
Look serious!

00:06:42.070 --> 00:06:43.470
I better get a move on!

00:06:43.770 --> 00:06:44.470
Woo-ha-ha!

00:06:51.740 --> 00:06:59.960
The Space Development Corporation, located in the heart of G-Island City, a new-

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:04.280
city complex built in Tokyo Bay. It serves as headquarters for the space

00:07:04.280 --> 00:07:10.340
technology giant. But beneath its public front, a world-class defense organization

00:07:10.340 --> 00:07:16.710
lies hidden at the bottom of the ocean, unknown to the rest of us. Its name is the

00:07:16.710 --> 00:07:23.700
Gutsy Geoid Guard, or 3G for short. But just what is the 3G organization and why

00:07:23.700 --> 00:07:27.100
are they armed with the mysterious mechalion named Galleon?

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:31.300
Good morning, team. At ease.

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:39.740
Professor, could you possibly make a quieter entrance next time?

00:07:39.860 --> 00:07:41.680
Sure thing, Chief. Sorry about that.

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:44.300
It's just that these jet rollers are a little hard to control.

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:47.540
So, what's going on with Galleon?

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:49.460
I'll put it up on the main screen, sir.

00:07:53.760 --> 00:07:55.600
Can't believe he broke through his chains.

00:07:55.880 --> 00:07:58.320
He hasn't so much as flinched in over two years.

00:07:58.420 --> 00:07:59.980
Looks to me like he's trying to get out.

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:02.180
The question is, where does he want to go?

00:08:02.280 --> 00:08:03.580
That would be garbage island.

00:08:03.720 --> 00:08:06.610
Yuma, we have an emergency situation here. Where are you?

00:08:07.240 --> 00:08:08.680
There's no time to lose, Chief!

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:10.720
I'm flying over Tokyo Bay as we speak,

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:13.300
and I'm gonna send you some video that'll blow you away!

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:18.430
What is that?

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:23.500
It's like the type that struck here two years ago.

00:08:25.680 --> 00:08:28.600
This thing looks like it's made out of trashed electronics!

00:08:28.760 --> 00:08:29.980
Quick one, get it!

00:08:30.800 --> 00:08:42.270
Six percent chance he'll compromise that gate within the hour!

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:47.120
Chief, we're going to have to release Gallagher.

00:08:47.140 --> 00:08:52.360
Very well then. Prepare the triple deck flying carrier for launch and open gate number three.

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:53.400
Yes, sir!

00:10:06.590 --> 00:10:11.190
As far as we can tell from the satellite images, the entire boat seems to have been consumed by it.

00:10:11.390 --> 00:10:14.210
Along with five kids? This can't be happening.

00:10:14.750 --> 00:10:15.470
Huma here!

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:18.790
All the other remaining survivors from the boat have been rescued.

00:10:20.310 --> 00:10:24.190
Aw, great! They scrambled some self-defense for us, Jax!

00:10:49.860 --> 00:10:51.930
Particoblast using a microwave term!

00:10:54.280 --> 00:10:55.980
That robot manages to reach Tokyo!

00:10:58.730 --> 00:10:59.790
Capital will be destroyed!

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:00.900
system.

00:11:55.630 --> 00:11:59.980
P.O. Bay now captured a tour boat, and we have word

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:01.660
that some students who were on a field trip

00:12:01.660 --> 00:12:02.860
are still trapped inside.

00:12:08.780 --> 00:12:10.900
Two jets scrambled by the self-defense force

00:12:10.900 --> 00:12:13.060
along with a gigantic lion robot

00:12:13.060 --> 00:12:14.060
of unknown origin

00:12:14.060 --> 00:12:16.320
were shot down when they attempted to attack it.

00:12:17.140 --> 00:12:18.340
It's that lion!

00:12:21.690 --> 00:12:22.490
Please, sir!

00:12:22.870 --> 00:12:24.090
What's wrong, Ushiyama?

00:12:24.580 --> 00:12:26.620
Chief, one of the kids trapped on that boat

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:27.780
is my little brother!

00:12:27.980 --> 00:12:28.220
What?

00:12:32.170 --> 00:12:35.390
Self-Defense Force can't attack with those kids in there, chief!

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:40.330
Even if they did attack, they wouldn't have the firepower to crack that robot's barrier system.

00:12:40.740 --> 00:12:44.620
There's only one person that can slip through that barrier system and rescue those children.

00:12:51.260 --> 00:12:52.640
Sugi, send in Guy.

00:12:55.310 --> 00:12:56.390
Do you copy?

00:12:56.690 --> 00:12:57.430
Loud and clear.

00:12:58.510 --> 00:12:59.970
I think you've kept me chomping at...

00:13:00.060 --> 00:13:05.810
bit long enough. Sorry about that. Do you have sufficient energy? Affirmative. I've got a full

00:13:05.810 --> 00:13:11.840
tank. And you know what to do. Rescue those kids, right? Go get them, guy. Affirmative. Preparing to

00:13:11.840 --> 00:13:14.270
engage. Drill cut!

00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:54.740
I'm here to save you guys. Whoa, hold on there. Don't call me mister. I'm still only 20 years old little man. Now, let's get going.

00:14:24.410 --> 00:14:25.150
It just transformed!

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:32.040
It's just like what happened two years ago.

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:39.300
From now on, that entity shall be referred to as EIO2.

00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:49.330
EIO2 has entered the subway system and is headed toward the downtown area.

00:14:50.600 --> 00:14:56.050
Three minutes to Shinjuku Station.

00:14:56.430 --> 00:14:59.590
Issuing evacuation orders to anyone within a six-mile radius.

00:15:00.220 --> 00:15:01.920
But why is that thing heading downtown?

00:15:13.900 --> 00:15:17.700
Sorry, but when it comes to speed, nothing can come close to LinerGal.

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:29.960
Thanks to his internal heat generation, Galleon is 81.2% thawed and ready to mo-

00:15:30.520 --> 00:15:33.260
Chief, please! You gotta have him save my kid brother!

00:15:33.540 --> 00:15:37.090
I hear you. What are the odds of a successful fusion?

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:39.990
Up to 99% in simulation mode.

00:15:40.380 --> 00:15:43.900
But since we have no field data, we won't know unless we give it a try.

00:15:46.070 --> 00:15:46.990
Fusion authorized!

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:49.610
Skye, you've been cleared for fusion!

00:15:49.870 --> 00:15:50.950
Well, it's about time.

00:17:01.628 --> 00:17:08.628
When Guy, the cyborg, achieves fusion with Galleon, they are transformed into the mighty mechanoid known as Gygar.

00:17:39.788 --> 00:17:40.788
Too slow!

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:02.860
Hey, stop calling me mister! I told you, I'm only 20 years old!

00:18:16.200 --> 00:18:17.380
Does it look good?

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:25.920
Shin!

00:18:26.430 --> 00:18:26.930
Well, professor?

00:18:28.110 --> 00:18:29.970
Probability of achieving final fuchs-

00:18:30.890 --> 00:18:32.930
has got to be pretty close to zero.

00:18:33.530 --> 00:18:36.010
Success rates are nothing but scientific theory.

00:18:36.500 --> 00:18:38.500
A brave heart will defy any odds.

00:18:39.460 --> 00:18:41.080
Vinyl Fusion authorized!

00:18:41.950 --> 00:18:45.250
Yes Sir! Fusion program drive?

00:18:55.880 --> 00:18:56.520
HUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUU

00:19:56.770 --> 00:19:59.840
At last, the true hero we've been waiting for has arrived.

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:04.560
He's finally been born, and his name is Gowgiger, the King of Brave.

00:20:05.910 --> 00:20:06.370
Please!

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:15.810
It's up to you now, brave one.

00:20:25.040 --> 00:20:25.940
And they're sh-

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:30.100
Thank you.

00:21:30.440 --> 00:21:33.240
Okay, you asked for it.

00:21:33.710 --> 00:21:34.090
Who?

00:21:34.410 --> 00:21:35.070
And?

00:21:35.440 --> 00:21:43.100
I've got Golgu 4.

00:22:41.260 --> 00:22:41.480
that

00:23:45.130 --> 00:23:47.110
now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:47.780 --> 00:23:50.080
The core is ripped out from the enemy robot,

00:23:50.340 --> 00:23:51.720
but what exactly is it?

00:23:52.110 --> 00:23:55.010
There's no time to panic before a new enemy emerges,

00:23:55.330 --> 00:23:56.950
shattering the peace of the city,

00:23:57.250 --> 00:23:59.630
with Geigar suddenly unable to transform.

00:24:00.092 --> 00:24:02.472
Will the goddess of victory smile upon him?

00:24:03.004 --> 00:24:05.944
Next episode of Gal Geiger, King of Braves.

00:24:06.204 --> 00:24:08.204
The boy with green hair.

00:24:08.636 --> 00:24:09.736
Stay tuned for the order.

00:24:09.976 --> 00:24:11.176
Final Fusion approved.

00:24:12.252 --> 00:24:15.012
This is the key to victory, so don't miss it.
